PBDM ( ATTRIB PARA[4 ] * 0.25 )
PAAX P3
PBAX Y
POFF 0
NAPP 0

END
NEW SCYLINDER
TUFL true
PDIS ( ATTRIB PARA[12 ] - ATTRIB PARA[11 ] )
PDIA ( ATTRIB RPRO INDI )
PHEI PARAM 11
PAXI P3
NAPP 0

END
NEW SSPHERE
TUFL true
PDIS 0
PDIA ( ATTRIB PARA[4 ] * 0.75 )
PAXI P3
NAPP 0

END
END
