NEW PTAXIS
NUMB 1
PCON PARAM 2
PBOR PARAM 1
PDIS 0
PAXI -Z

END
NEW PTAXIS
NUMB 2
PCON PARAM 3
PBOR PARAM 1
PDIS PARAM 5
PAXI Z

END
NEW PTMIX
NUMB 3
PCON 0
PBOR 0
PX unset
PY 0
PZ ( ATTRIB RPRO DIST )
PAXI X

END
END
