PTYP DIST
PPRO ( ATTRIB DESP[3 ] )
DPRO ( 500 )
PURP DESP
NUMB 3
DTIT 'OPERATOR LENGHT'

END
NEW DATA
DKEY FLTH
PPRO ( ATTRIB PARA[6 ] )
DPRO ( 0 )
PURP UNSE
NUMB 21
DTIT 'FLANGE THICKNESS'

END
END
