OBST 0
TUFL true
PDIA PARAM 6
PHEI PARAM 7
PAXI -P1
NAPP 0

END
NEW SCYLINDER
CLFL true
TUFL true
PDIS unset
PDIA ( 0.25 * ATTRIB RPRO BOXS )
