NEW DATA /TPI-00ONP-FG-600LB-DT/OVERALL
DESC 'OVERALL DIMENSION'
DKEY HEIG
PTYP DIST
PPRO ( ATTRIB DESP[1 ] )
DPRO ( 150 )
PURP DESP
NUMB 1
DTIT 'OVERALL DIMENSION'

END
