NEW PTAXIS
NUMB 1
PCON PARAM 3
PBOR PARAM 1
PDIS ( 0.5 * ATTRIB RPRO HEIG )
PAXI -X

END
NEW PTCAR
NUMB 4
PCON 0
PBOR 0
PX 0
PY 0
PZ ( ATTRIB RPRO DIST )
PTCDI X

END
NEW PTCAR
NUMB 5
PCON 0
PBOR 0
PX 0
PY 0
PZ ( ATTRIB RPRO DIST )
