PHEI PARAM 7
PAXI -P2
NAPP 0

END
NEW SBOX
CLFL true
TUFL true
PX 0
PY ( ATTRIB RPRO COAY )
PZ ( ATTRIB RPRO COAZ )
PXLE ( ATTRIB RPRO CODX )
PYLE ( ATTRIB RPRO CODY )
PZLE ( ATTRIB RPRO CODZ )

END
