PTYP ANGL
PPRO ( ATTRIB DESP[3 ] )
DPRO ( 0 )
PURP DESP
NUMB 3
DTIT 'OPERATOR ANGLE'

END
NEW DATA /TPI-00OCO-WF-600LB-DT/DIAMETER-OPERA
DESC 'OPERATOR DIAMETER'
DKEY OPAD
PTYP DIST
PPRO ( ATTRIB DESP[4 ] )
DPRO ( 75 )
PURP DESP
NUMB 4
DTIT 'OPERATOR A DIAMETER  '

END
NEW DATA /TPI-00OCO-WF-600LB-DT/LENGHT-OPERA
